  "website": "https://www.pickyourown.org/AME2email.php?ADDT=UPDN&amp;EN=Gardener%27s+Orchard+and+Bakery&amp;ES=MO&amp;EC=Polk+County&amp;EP=+417-742-3093&amp;ECT=Brighton&amp;EZ=65617&amp;EA=4455+W+Farm+Rd+2&amp;EA2=&amp;EW=https%3A%2F%2Fgardenersorchardandbakery.com&amp;RD=RD&amp;EF=Gardenersorchard&amp;EM=gardenersfarm%40gmail.com&amp;EX=US&amp;PG=MOsw.htm&amp;OP=July+for+peaches+and+in+September+for+apples%3B%3B+&amp;IG=&amp;TW=&amp;DS=.+Gardener%27s+Orchard+and+Bakery+is+a+45+acre+family+run+orchard+and+farm+run+by+the+Gradinariu+Family+since+2013.+The+orchard+was+initially+started+by+the+Plaster+Family+in+the+early+1980%27s.+The+Gradinariu+Family+has+expanded+the+farm+to+include+seasonal+produce%2C+berries%2C+a+bakery%2C+fresh+apple+cider+and+educational+farm+tours.+A+specialty+fruit+farm+offering+apples%2C+peaches%2C+blackberries%2C+blueberries+and+strawberries.+We+have+a+bakery+open+year+round+on+the+farm+that+makes+breads%2C+pies%2C+danishes%2C+caramel+apples+and+a+variety+of+homemade+bakery+items+with+no+added+preservatives.+We+produce+an+all-natural+apple+cider+September+-+January+that+is+produced+weekly+with+no+added+sugar+or+preservatives.+The+2500+tree+orchard+has+13+varieties+of+Apple+trees+and+15+varieties+of+Peach+treesGardener%27s+Orchard+is+the+ultimate+You-Pick+family+fun+farm+with+apples%2C+peaches%2C+berries%2C+tomatoes%2C+bakery%2C+and+family+fun+farm-experience+park.+The+orchard+is+inclusive+on+20+acres+of+a+65+acre+family+farm.+T...&amp;DR=+",
